### Вивести товари
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### Вивести товар
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/6ace0eaee46fd0099ca73773

### Створити товар
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ноутбук HP",
  "sku": "LAPTOP-004",
  "description": "Ноутбук для роботи",
  "price": 56000,
  "category": "Електроніка",
  "stock": 2,
  "companyId": "6ace0dab922bf539b038a133"
}

### Видалити товар
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/6ace0eaee46fd0099ca73773

